{"seq":1,"slug":"dowhy-econml","title":"DoWhy 与 EconML 工具生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/practice/dowhy-econml","wordCount":1287,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"dowhy-与-econml-工具生态\">DoWhy 与 EconML 工具生态</h1><p>因果推断的理论方法再精妙，如果没有可靠的软件工具链来承载，就无法在工业界落地。PyWhy 生态（由微软研究院发起，现为 Linux Foundation AI &amp; Data 项目）提供了一套完整的因果推断工具栈：<strong>DoWhy</strong> 负责因果建模、识别和稳健性检验；<strong>EconML</strong> 负责基于 ML 的异质效应估计。两者无缝集成，覆盖了从&quot;画因果图&quot;到&quot;输出个性化 CATE&quot;的端到端流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph PyWhy-Ecosystem&#10;        A[DoWhy 因果建模]&#10;        B[EconML 效应估计]&#10;        C[CausalML Uber]&#10;        D[CausalPy 贝叶斯]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; |识别策略| B&#10;    B --&gt; |估计结果| A&#10;    A --&gt; |反驳检验| E[稳健性报告]&#10;    F[因果图 DAG] --&gt; A&#10;    G[观测数据] --&gt; A&#10;    G --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; H[CATE 估计]&#10;    B --&gt; I[策略评估]&#10;    B --&gt; J[个性化决策]\">graph TD\n    subgraph PyWhy-Ecosystem\n        A[DoWhy 因果建模]\n        B[EconML 效应估计]\n        C[CausalML Uber]\n        D[CausalPy 贝叶斯]\n    end\n    A --&gt; |识别策略| B\n    B --&gt; |估计结果| A\n    A --&gt; |反驳检验| E[稳健性报告]\n    F[因果图 DAG] --&gt; A\n    G[观测数据] --&gt; A\n    G --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; H[CATE 估计]\n    B --&gt; I[策略评估]\n    B --&gt; J[个性化决策]</pre><h2 id=\"dowhy-因果推断的四步法\">DoWhy：因果推断的四步法</h2><p>DoWhy 将因果推断过程强制结构化为四个清晰步骤——这不仅是工具设计，更是方法论的编码：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. Model（建模）</td>\n<td>声明因果假设</td>\n<td>DAG（因果图）</td>\n<td>CausalModel 对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. Identify（识别）</td>\n<td>判断效应能否从数据估计</td>\n<td>因果图结构</td>\n<td>估计量表达式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. Estimate（估计）</td>\n<td>用数据计算因果效应</td>\n<td>数据 + 识别策略</td>\n<td>数值估计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. Refute（反驳）</td>\n<td>检验估计的稳健性</td>\n<td>估计结果</td>\n<td>稳健性报告</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>为什么&quot;建模先于估计&quot;如此重要</strong>：</p>\n<p>传统数据分析的思路是&quot;先跑模型，看结果是否显著&quot;。DoWhy 颠覆了这个顺序：你必须<strong>先声明因果假设</strong>（画出 DAG），然后 DoWhy 基于图结构自动判断你的因果问题能否被回答。如果不能（例如存在不可阻断的后门路径），它会明确告诉你——而不是默默给出一个有偏的数字。</p>\n<h3 id=\"识别策略\">识别策略</h3><p>DoWhy 支持的识别策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n<th>图形标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>后门调整（Backdoor）</td>\n<td>存在足够的可观测混杂</td>\n<td>所有后门路径可被阻断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前门调整（Frontdoor）</td>\n<td>存在完全中介变量</td>\n<td>处理→中介→结果 + 无直接效应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具变量（IV）</td>\n<td>存在合格的工具</td>\n<td>Z→T→Y，Z⊥Y</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回归不连续（RD）</td>\n<td>处理分配有跳跃阈值</td>\n<td>局部随机化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"反驳检验\">反驳检验</h3><p>DoWhy 的**反驳（Refute）**步骤是其独特价值所在——它提供了一组自动化的敏感性检验：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反驳方法</th>\n<th>检验逻辑</th>\n<th>如果通过</th>\n<th>如果失败</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>安慰剂处理</td>\n<td>用随机噪声替代真实处理</td>\n<td>效应应消失（→0）</td>\n<td>存在伪相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机公共原因</td>\n<td>添加随机混杂变量</td>\n<td>效应应稳定</td>\n<td>结果对混杂敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子集验证</td>\n<td>在数据子集上重新估计</td>\n<td>效应应一致</td>\n<td>存在异质性或选择偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未观测混杂（Rosenbaum bounds）</td>\n<td>假设存在隐藏混杂</td>\n<td>效应在合理范围内稳健</td>\n<td>结论对隐藏混杂脆弱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"econml-工业级-cate-估计\">EconML：工业级 CATE 估计</h2><p>EconML（版本 0.16.0，2025 年 7 月发布）是 PyWhy 生态中负责&quot;重估计&quot;的组件。它实现了第二、三章所有方法的生产级版本：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模块</th>\n<th>实现的方法</th>\n<th>接口特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>econml.dml</code></td>\n<td>LinearDML, SparseLinearDML, CausalForestDML, NonParamDML</td>\n<td>统一的 <code>fit(Y,T,X,W)</code> → <code>effect(X)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>econml.dr</code></td>\n<td>DRLearner, ForestDRLearner, LinearDRLearner</td>\n<td>双重稳健 + 置信区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>econml.metalearners</code></td>\n<td>SLearner, TLearner, XLearner, DomainAdaptationLearner</td>\n<td>即插即用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>econml.iv</code></td>\n<td>DMLIV, NonParamDMLIV, LinearIntentToTreatDRIV</td>\n<td>工具变量 DML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>econml.policy</code></td>\n<td>PolicyTree, DRPolicyTree, DRPolicyForest</td>\n<td>策略优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>econml.score</code></td>\n<td>RScorer, EnsembleCateEstimator</td>\n<td>模型选择</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"econml-的统一-api-设计\">EconML 的统一 API 设计</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 所有 EconML 估计器共享相同的 API&#10;estimator.fit(Y, T, X=X, W=W, inference=&#39;auto&#39;)&#10;# Y: 结果; T: 处理; X: 效应修饰变量; W: 控制变量（只影响 nuisance）&#10;&#10;# 推断 API&#10;estimator.effect(X_test)                    # 点估计&#10;estimator.effect_interval(X_test, alpha=0.05)  # 置信区间&#10;estimator.effect_inference(X_test)           # 完整推断对象（p值、CI等）&#10;&#10;# ATE&#10;estimator.ate(X)&#10;estimator.ate_interval(X, alpha=0.05)&#10;&#10;# 模型诊断&#10;estimator.score(Y, T, X, W)                # 残差拟合优度\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 所有 EconML 估计器共享相同的 API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">estimator.fit(Y, T, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">X</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">W</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">W, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">inference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'auto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Y: 结果; T: 处理; X: 效应修饰变量; W: 控制变量（只影响 nuisance）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 推断 API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">estimator.effect(X_test)                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 点估计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">estimator.effect_interval(X_test, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 置信区间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">estimator.effect_inference(X_test)           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 完整推断对象（p值、CI等）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">estimator.ate(X)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">estimator.ate_interval(X, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 模型诊断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">estimator.score(Y, T, X, W)                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 残差拟合优度</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>X vs W 的区分</strong>是 EconML 设计的精髓：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>X</code>（效应修饰变量）：CATE 是它的函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\tau}(X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><code>W</code>（控制变量）：只参与 nuisance 估计，不出现在最终 CATE 中</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这让用户明确哪些变量驱动异质性（业务可解释），哪些只是需要控制的混杂（技术细节）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dowhy-econml-联合使用\">DoWhy + EconML 联合使用</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import dowhy&#10;from dowhy import CausalModel&#10;from econml.dml import CausalForestDML&#10;&#10;# Step 1: DoWhy 建模与识别&#10;model = CausalModel(&#10;    data=df,&#10;    treatment=&#39;treatment&#39;,&#10;    outcome=&#39;outcome&#39;,&#10;    graph=&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    digraph {&#10;        age -&gt; treatment; age -&gt; outcome;&#10;        income -&gt; treatment; income -&gt; outcome;&#10;        treatment -&gt; outcome;&#10;    }&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;)&#10;identified = model.identify_effect(proceed_when_unidentifiable=True)&#10;&#10;# Step 2: EconML 估计（通过 DoWhy 接口）&#10;estimate = model.estimate_effect(&#10;    identified,&#10;    method_name=&quot;backdoor.econml.dml.CausalForestDML&quot;,&#10;    method_params={&#10;        &quot;init_params&quot;: {&#39;n_estimators&#39;: 2000},&#10;        &quot;fit_params&quot;: {}&#10;    }&#10;)&#10;&#10;# Step 3: DoWhy 反驳&#10;refutation = model.refute_estimate(&#10;    identified, estimate,&#10;    method_name=&quot;placebo_treatment_refuter&quot;&#10;)&#10;print(refutation)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dowhy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dowhy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CausalModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> econml.dml </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CausalForestDML</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Step 1: DoWhy 建模与识别</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CausalModel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    treatment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'treatment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'outcome'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    digraph {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        age -> treatment; age -> outcome;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        income -> treatment; income -> outcome;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        treatment -> outcome;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">identified </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.identify_effect(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">proceed_when_unidentifiable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Step 2: EconML 估计（通过 DoWhy 接口）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">estimate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.estimate_effect(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    identified,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    method_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"backdoor.econml.dml.CausalForestDML\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    method_params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"init_params\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'n_estimators'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"fit_params\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Step 3: DoWhy 反驳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">refutation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.refute_estimate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    identified, estimate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    method_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"placebo_treatment_refuter\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(refutation)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"causalpy-贝叶斯因果推断\">CausalPy：贝叶斯因果推断</h2><p>CausalPy（v0.8.1）是 PyMC Labs 维护的贝叶斯因果推断库，专注于准实验设计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>CausalPy 实现</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>合成控制</td>\n<td><code>SyntheticControl</code></td>\n<td>贝叶斯先验约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间断时间序列</td>\n<td><code>InterruptedTimeSeries</code></td>\n<td>自动趋势建模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回归不连续</td>\n<td><code>RegressionDiscontinuity</code></td>\n<td>带宽自动选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DID</td>\n<td><code>DifferenceinDifferences</code></td>\n<td>贝叶斯推断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CausalPy 的独特价值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>全贝叶斯推断</strong>：不是点估计+渐近 CI，而是完整后验分布</li>\n<li><strong>模型比较</strong>：通过 WAIC/LOO 在不同因果假设之间做模型选择</li>\n<li><strong>PyMC 后端</strong>：可以自定义先验，编码领域知识</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"工具选择决策矩阵\">工具选择决策矩阵</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求</th>\n<th>推荐工具</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>端到端因果分析（建模→估计→验证）</td>\n<td>DoWhy + EconML</td>\n<td>四步法强制因果思考</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异质处理效应（CATE）估计</td>\n<td>EconML</td>\n<td>最全面的 CATE 方法库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准实验设计（DID/SC/ITS/RD）</td>\n<td>CausalPy</td>\n<td>贝叶斯推断 + 可视化优秀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速 Uplift Modeling</td>\n<td>CausalML（Uber）</td>\n<td>与 sklearn 兼容性最好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>R 语言 + 因果森林</td>\n<td>grf</td>\n<td>原始实现 + 理论最前沿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果发现（学习 DAG）</td>\n<td>DoWhy gcm 模块 或 causal-learn</td>\n<td>根因分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PyWhy 生态（DoWhy + EconML）是因果 ML 的工业标准工具栈</li>\n<li>DoWhy 的四步法（Model→Identify→Estimate→Refute）编码了因果推断的方法论</li>\n<li>EconML 的 X/W 分离设计让业务可解释性和统计严谨性并存</li>\n<li>CausalPy 填补了贝叶斯因果推断的空白，适合准实验设计</li>\n<li>工具选择取决于具体需求：全流程、CATE、准实验、或因果发现</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>兄弟文档：<a href=\"sensitivity-analysis\">敏感性分析与稳健性检验</a> 深入 DoWhy refute 步骤的理论基础</li>\n<li>跨库链接：<a href=\"../../causal-inference/causal-applications/causal-product-analytics\">因果推断 — 因果产品分析</a> 了解因果推断在产品分析中的业务应用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DoWhy 与 EconML 工具生态","id":"dowhy-与-econml-工具生态"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"DoWhy：因果推断的四步法","id":"dowhy-因果推断的四步法"},{"level":3,"text":"识别策略","id":"识别策略"},{"level":3,"text":"反驳检验","id":"反驳检验"},{"level":2,"text":"EconML：工业级 CATE 估计","id":"econml-工业级-cate-估计"},{"level":3,"text":"EconML 的统一 API 设计","id":"econml-的统一-api-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"DoWhy + EconML 联合使用","id":"dowhy-econml-联合使用"},{"level":2,"text":"CausalPy：贝叶斯因果推断","id":"causalpy-贝叶斯因果推断"},{"level":2,"text":"工具选择决策矩阵","id":"工具选择决策矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"连续处理与广义倾向得分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/modern/continuous-treatment"},"next":{"title":"敏感性分析与稳健性检验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference-advanced/practice/sensitivity-analysis"}}